      "id": "l1",
      "text": "Sunday morning. The whole city is still blue.",
      "voice": "am_adam",
      "speed": 0.95,
      "start": 5.6,
      "duration": 2.697,
      "language": "en-us"
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "text": "Then the bakery opens, and the day gets its first color.",
      "voice": "am_adam",
      "speed": 0.95,
      "start": 9.0,
      "duration": 3.179,
      "language": "en-us"
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "text": "The park adds pink. And, apparently, a passenger.",
      "voice": "am_adam",
      "speed": 0.95,
      "start": 21.7,
      "duration": 2.965,
      "language": "en-us"
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "text": "By the river, every color overlaps.",
